
<https://w3c.github.io/rdf-tests/rdf/rdf11/rdf-mt/manifest.ttl#datatypes-intensional-xsd-integer-string-incompatible> a <http://www.w3.org/2001/sw/DataAccess/tests/test-manifest#PositiveEntailmentTest>;
  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> """
