<https://w3c.github.io/rdf-tests/rdf/rdf11/rdf-mt/manifest.ttl#datatypes-intensional-xsd-integer-decimal-compatible> a <http://www.w3.org/2001/sw/DataAccess/tests/test-manifest#NegativeEntailmentTest>;
  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> """
    The claim that xsd:integer is a subClassOF xsd:decimal is not
    incompatible with using the intensional semantics for
    datatypes.
  """;
